WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.500
Ishtar Family's Truth Revealed

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:30.940
How is the Ra card's analysis going?

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:36.810
Well, I've linked to Industrial Illusions' host computer to analyze it.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.800
This is...

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.510
Big brother?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.050
Impossible...

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:47.740
I can understand the text.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:53.400
It reveals The Winged Dragon of Ra's terrifying effects!

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.830
It's writing known as hieratic text.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.930
Only the chosen ones can understand it.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.800
There's a young priest fighting the Pharaoh.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.240
Above him is clearly Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.840
Impossible!  The memory that flashed inside my mind...

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.620
What's wrong, big brother?

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.060
What's happening to me?

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:25.490
Big brother...

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:30.140
Four duelists have advanced to the semifinals.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:33.430
Today's tournament matches are over.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:40.770
The Battle Ship will arrive at a third duel arena tomorrow morning for the semifinals.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.850
Third duel arena?

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:46.850
Because we're pretty far from Domino City now.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.010
I wonder what the third duel arena is like.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.480
I don't care where I'm dueling!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.450
Yugi, let's make the finals!

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:57.360
Yeah.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.490
Aren't you and the other Yugi both tired?

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.160
Yeah.  Because many things happened today.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.840
Too many people are getting hurt in this tournament.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.910
I didn't expect it to be so tough.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.680
Anyway, let's go to Mai's room.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:19.280
Yeah.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.050
Ishizu...

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.770
I was worried about her.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.720
May I join you?

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.860
Shizuka, how's Mai?

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:44.770
Mai...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.040
Just wait, Mai.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:52.360
I promise to defeat Marik.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.780
Brother...

00:03:55.400 --> 00:04:00.850
No matter how often you tell me to stay strong, I can't stand this anymore.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.290
Mai, Bakura...  Everyone who fights end up like this.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.720
Shizuka...

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:12.080
This isn't the world I wanted to see!

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:14.670
Shizuka...

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.930
Sorry, Shizuka.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.610
You should never avert your eyes.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:33.080
Even if the world is full of tragedy, there are those who would do anything to see this world.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:42.630
Since ancient Egypt, my gravekeeper family have suffered greatly to fufill our mission.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:45.070
Gravekeeper family...

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:49.800
Due to the great power of the Millennium Items.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.500
Ishizu, are you Marik's sister?

00:04:55.240 --> 00:05:00.260
Please tell me why he wants to kill me.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:06.120
Why is his evil side trying to kill everyone?

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:11.050
Yugi...  The one chosen to carry the Pharaoh's soul...

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.800
Ishizu!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:28.020
Okay.  I'll tell you the tragic tale of the Ishtar family.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.880
We, the Ishtars, are the descendants of gravekeepers...

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:38.200
... who protect two Millennium Items and the location of the Pharaoh's memories.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:43.800
We separated ourselves from the world, living secretly underground.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:51.200
Due to the gravekeeper's ritual, each successor had the Pharaoh's memories carved into his back.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.450
And he had to stay away from the outside world.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.600
That was my brother Marik's burden.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:05.240
The tragedy occurred five years ago, a year after Marik underwent the ritual.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.760
I'm going!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.150
Sis!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.850
Marik, you're too loud.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.540
It's fine.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.290
Our father is asleep.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.840
We've been planning for this day.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.290
Our father won't know that we went outside for a little while.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.540
But if he does, it'll be big trouble.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:32.460
Breaking our family's rules is explicitly forbidden.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.980
It'll be fine.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:38.140
Even if anything happens, Rishido will cover for us.  Right?

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:45.520
Sis, I want to see the outside world.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.080
No matter what.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:54.690
Please!  Just this once!

00:06:56.940 --> 00:07:00.770
Ishizu, I'll take care of the rest.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.730
Please grant Marik's wishes.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.400
Sis...

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.100
All right.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:11.770
Let's go in the morning.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:12.900
Hooray!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.980
But only for an hour.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.880
When time's up, we're coming back.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:20.660
Okay!

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:49.200
It was the first time Marik felt sunlight.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:01.060
Wow!  So this is what a city is like!

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.370
There's so many people!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.380
Marik.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.440
Don't take anything in this world.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.530
I know!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:20.740
That's horrible.  You shouldn't step on a book.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.430
The pictures look real.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.820
How fun!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.450
What's this vehicle?

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.370
Marik.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.250
Kid, you've never seen a TV before?

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.420
Marik!  Come!

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:01.550
Wow!  I saw other places inside that box!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:02.860
It's called a TV.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.080
Is that so?

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:08.660
The TV also showed a weird vehicle.  What was it?

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:09.760
A motorcycle.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:13.070
Motorcycle?  Wow!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:18.970
But I'll never be able to ride a motorcycle in this wide open land.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:25.760
Sis?

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.280
Marik, time's up.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:29.150
Let's go home.

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:30.810
Already?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.830
No more!  You promised!

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.260
I know.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:41.400
Let me keep this picture of a motorcycle!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.320
No!  What if Father finds it?

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.160
Please...

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.760
Oh well.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.200
Don't let Father find it.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.290
Let's go.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.080
The Pharaoh's soul will resurrect soon.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.180
Pharaoh?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.510
Who are you?

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:12.520
Gravekeeper, due to the Pharaoh's will, destiny will lead you to tragedy.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.460
Find the Pharaoh's soul.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.120
Who are you?

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.390
Wait!

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.170
Tragedy?

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:21.560
The Pharaoh's will?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.320
That man was Shadi?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.320
Yes.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:49.020
He appears before those related to the Millennium Items.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:55.570
By breaking my family's rules and letting Marik see the outside world...

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:59.370
...the Ishtar family was destined to be destroyed.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:04.340
He's not here.

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:07.340
He wore an ankh around his neck.

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:11.110
It looked similar to the Rod and Necklace that we're guarding-

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:14.180
Marik!  You can't talk about that here!

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:15.550
I'm sorry.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.550
Forget everything about today.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.800
Everything you saw and that man.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.510
We have to go back inside?

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.570
Marik, follow me quietly.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.420
Sis!  Just for a moment!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.000
Marik!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.220
I know.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.770
Don't make a sound.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.770
Sis, what's that?

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.740
There's an alarm!

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:21.420
I didn't notice it before because it was dark.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.350
Sis, what's wrong?

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:24.670
Rishido!

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.720
Sis!  What's wrong?

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.730
Please forgive us, Father!

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:37.000
Rishido...

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.370
Rishido!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:49.950
Rishido!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.240
Master Marik...

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.000
Marik...  Ishizu...

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:08.260
This is what happens when you break our family's rules.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.940
This servant was punished for your actions.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.310
Rishido...

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:17.540
Marik?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.990
Marik, you're next.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:31.850
Marik!  You dare defy me?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:42.700
Thanks for eliminating Rishido, Father.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.400
I feel refreshed.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:50.840
Marik?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.840
What's up with you?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.900
This is mine now.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.120
No!  You're not allowed to touch the Millennium Items!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:09.740
It seems to accept me.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.360
Return it to the altar!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.280
Be quiet!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.820
Marik!  How dare you!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.340
My body...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.800
Marik!  What are you doing?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.800
Back off!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.680
You're not Marik...

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:37.580
I'll kill you first, Father.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.240
Don't!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:54.080
All that's left is her.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.000
Master Marik...

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.140
You're still alive?

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.260
Stay dead!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.810
Master Marik...

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.030
Master Marik!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.470
Rishido, what happened to me?

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.550
Don't look!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:22.820
Father?

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.820
Father!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:25.790
Master Marik!

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:30.570
You're...

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:36.860
The soul of the great Pharaoh gave you this destiny.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.510
The Pharaoh will resurrect soon.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.870
Find the Pharaoh, Marik.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.550
Pharaoh...

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:54.020
My soul caused Marik's tragedy?

00:15:54.570 --> 00:16:01.350
But whatever the reason, I can't forgive him!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:07.470
Marik's dark powers are gradually killing Mai.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:11.750
Mai will die unless we defeat him!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:22.470
Defeating Marik's evil side is the only way to change my brother's dark future.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.590
Please use your powers to save Marik!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.200
We're turning off the lights soon.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.270
All competitors must return to their rooms.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:40.270
Brother, we'll look after Mai.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:43.280
Okay.  Let's return to our rooms.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.570
But you don't have a room.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:49.720
I can't stay here, so I'm crashing in your room.

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:52.650
Seriously?  Oh well...

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.650
Take care of her, Shizuka and Anzu.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:00.890
Yugi, I haven't forgotten our promise.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:07.120
When I duel you, I'll use all my strength!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:13.770
Let Ishizu see the future to see if you and Yugi duel in the finals!

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:17.020
I can't ask her that point blank!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:21.540
I no longer have the power to see the future.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:26.150
After Seto Kaiba changed the future in our duel.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:27.680
Kaiba?

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:34.370
To resurrect the Pharaoh's memories...

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:39.700
...you'll need the five remaining Millennium Items and the three God Cards.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.480
This belongs to you.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:48.110
This completes one of my missions as a gravekeeper.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:51.300
Let's return to our rooms before lights out.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:51.960
Yeah.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.480
Good night, everyone.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:56.650
Good night.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:57.940
Good night!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:07.260
I now have two Millennium Items.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.430
Ishizu, wait!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.660
Please tell me.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:21.820
When the seven Millennium Items are placed in the tablet at Egypt's secret temple...

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:23.660
What happens to Yugi?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.110
What happens to the other Yugi?

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:33.400
Every soul has a place it must return to.

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.790
Place it must return to...

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.770
You can't sleep?

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.310
The other me.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.250
What are you thinking about?

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.460
Well...

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:11.680
When we gather all the Millennium Items...

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:18.800
...I'll eventually have to go to Egypt and place them in the tablet of memories.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:24.930
That's my role as the vessel for your soul.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.510
When that time comes...

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.080
Let's go to sleep!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.570
Tomorrow is the finals.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.370
Yeah.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.220
Partner...

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.660
Rishido, time to die.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.770
You'll trouble me if you're alive.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.400
Bakura?

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.960
I brought a friend.

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:06.210
Your other personality.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.650
Marik's other part.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:16.590
When he brainwashed Bakura with the Millennium Rod, he implanted a part of his soul into him.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:19.860
I won't let you kill Rishido!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.240
Keep your promise.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.630
I get the Millennium Rod.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:27.930
That reminds me.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.470
You collect Millennium Items.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:38.530
If you're willing to give it to me, I won't add you to the collection of people I've erased.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:43.240
I'll break you apart into pieces, like a puzzle.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.420
Try it.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.400
Die!

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.770
Stay there.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.930
I'll deal with you after I get rid of Rishido.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.770
My arm!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.240
You!

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.180
Your power is nothing special.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:14.420
We were both chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.920
We must settle this in a Shadow Game.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.890
I'm looking forward to it.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:30.260
The only rule is that the loser vanishes.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.700
Bring it!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:51.540
In order to defeat Marik's evil side, Bakura and Marik's other personality duel as a tag team.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:56.280
Chosen by the Millennium Items, they're dueling in a Shadow Game.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:22:00.080
The loser is devoured by the shadows?

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:04.630
As Bakura loses life points, his body vanishes!

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:07.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Marik vs Bakura

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:08.860
Duel, standby!

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:20.560
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:29.500
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:34.470
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:38.440
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:46.410
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:49.980
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:54.750
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:54.750 --> 00:23:04.860
And walk it without stopping

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:12.470
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:21.440
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:29.420
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:39.260
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
